,"roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:35387","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"なつかわ さらさ","creatorId":"vndb:s20673","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20673","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20673","name":"なつかわさらさ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:35389","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"冴木 其成","creatorId":"vndb:s3979","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3979","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3979","name":"さえきそれなり(冴木其成)","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:35390","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17865","characterName":"イカル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17865"},"originalCharacterName":"イカル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ikaru is quick-tempered yet kind, and doesn't hesitate to act on his own perception of what is right. He is a Kannagi no Tori with the appearance of a young red-haired boy. Despite being a Kannagi no Tori, he has failed to retrieve the soul of a human because of his continued interference with the deaths of his targets. He is tasked by his superior to retrieve the soul of Ruu on his death date, or cease to exist on Kannagi Mountain."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17865"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/7765d59138f7f8b35faf5a5aafd7f77ab0006fc14cfdf63586ebc4e4678bb473.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4c45a97a82bdbc1bac70999a8f94c9362ed46e4ff1c8d8260ecf358f65cfe4a.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴村 健一","creatorId":"vndb:s90","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s90","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s90","name":"鈴村 健一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18964","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17866","characterName":"綿貫 琉宇","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17866"},"originalCharacterName":"綿貫 琉宇","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ruu is a shy and good-natured young boy who is scheduled to die in an accident in one month. Ruu stays home with his uncle during his divorced parents' custody battle over him, and does not attend school at first. He meets Ikaru who pretended to be a classmate of his, and stays ignorant of Ikaru's position as a Kannagi no Tori, as well as his task to take his soul. Ruu has a pet hamster named Miris, who he claims he is able to understand and speak for."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17866"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/889ef3259b298bae3009ceaab46dfa325d01dedbea4b6092fa864ddd24d7f6af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/234ac41413a89d9a8479c3c79b52d77cc12f34e2b5fa067b73879a4b003575e6.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口 勝平","creatorId":"vndb:s122","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s122","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s122","name":"山口 勝平","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18965","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17867","characterName":"レンジャク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17867"},"originalCharacterName":"レンジャク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Renjaku is one of the Kannagi no Tori just like Ikaru. He has long white hair and a cold expression. His face shows no emotion but he does not hide the fact that he cares about his friend, and wants to make sure Ikaru completes his task. Renjaku is very serious about his duty towards bringing back souls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17867"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/783cd6fcc7a2cd7c6f109b883020dd6a3d2874b3a7c23496997f7cd92cf99ce1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94330e4f572dda770f446b888573144062ea8e1e06bc3bef04787f92a52f40bc.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"緑川 光","creatorId":"vndb:s73","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s73","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s73","name":"緑川 光","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18963","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17868","characterName":"深町 康哉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17868"},"originalCharacterName":"深町 康哉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fukamachi Yasunari is Ruu's uncle and a novelist. He is the brother of Ruu's mother, and takes care of Ruu while his parents are sorting out the issue of his custody. Yasunari welcomes Ikaru into his home, and also initially believes that Ikaru is a worried classmate of Ruu's. Yasunari used to date Akihito's sister, who died in an accident."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17868"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/619d96b12aba14e8a2ff3ae24d7b0958feaa6c5d96afb0b065f05e291958ce22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61866faffbecb922f83094392fc0cf964f0964a3308e157bdcfd092579cd3ab0.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森川 智之","creatorId":"vndb:s53","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s53","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s53","name":"森川智之","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18961","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17869","characterName":"真部 章仁","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17869"},"originalCharacterName":"真部 章仁","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Manabe Akihito is the gloomy younger brother of Fukamachi's dead girlfriend. He visits Fukamachi's household often to find out the truth about his sister's death, though always leaves displeased in the end. He has come to dislike Fukamachi because of this."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17869"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cccca14ad01c8daa7d3dbf0b441fb01e7bbc2f04a6fc0f4a3e99c9a9cab662a2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/96e673d0ece9a93cee3e6796b02ba77f2c13fbc47588344d9f0a4e9f679aca83.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"千葉 進歩","creatorI